pkit/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/deployments","created_at":"2026-10-24T14:58:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T18:45:19Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-27T01:40:45Z","git_url":"git://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit","homepage":null,"size":147886,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"Kotlin","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":167,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":167,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"<!-- nativecmpkit-item:audit:NATIVE-018 -->\n## Classification\n- **Finding:** NATIVE-018\n- **Priority:** Medium\n- **Evidence status:** `risk` (source/test evidence is not automatically a demonstrated exploit)\n- **Affected modules:** `calf-webview`\n- **Estimated complexity:** M\n- **Reviewed upstream baseline:** `af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6`; original commit preserved in this repository.\n\n## Exact code / symbols\n- [`calf-webview/src/desktopMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/ui/web/WebView.desktop.kt:50-54`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6/calf-webview/src/desktopMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/ui/web/WebView.desktop.kt#L50-L54) — `remember JFXPanel initialization`\n\n## Root cause\nJFXPanel() is created synchronously inside remember. The first panel can bootstrap JavaFX and enter a nested AWT event loop while Compose is composing/rendering; archived issue346 shows exactly this stack path. There is no coordinated preinitialization or failure UI.\n\n## Impact and preconditions\nOn affected runtime/host combinations first WebView composition may re-enter Compose rendering and throw Reentry into ignoringRedrawRequests. Missing graphics/native prerequisites can also abort toolkit startup, but their exact root causes differ.\n\n## Supporting evidence\n- Archived issue346 stack includes SwingInteropContainer reentry via JFXPanel.initFx and library WebView creation.\n- Current source retains direct remember { JFXPanel() }. Issue344 setting-thread failure is different and has a source fix (Platform.runLater at215-221).\n\n## Recommended solution\nReproduce on current supported hosts/Compose first. Establish a documented toolkit startup stage outside an active composition and an error/capability path; marshal UI objects to their required threads and preserve multiwindow lifecycle.\n\n## Risks and compatibility\nHistorical stack is evidence of a reported prior failure, not proof that current Compose1.12 reproduces it. JavaFX19 classifiers/prerequisites are separately tracked by build findings. Do not blindly move JFXPanel construction to a worker thread.\n\n## Required tests / acceptance criteria\n- Cold first WebView creation during recomposition with FX initially uninitialized.\n- macOS AWT/Metal and Linux X11/Wayland graphics matrices; repeated removal/recreation.\n- Explicit unsupported/headless environment result rather than unexplained renderer exception.\n\n## Dependencies\n- None identified.\n\n## Historical context\n- https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/346\n- https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/39\n- https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/151\n- https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/344\nOriginal upstream records (authors, IDs, timestamps, comments, reviews and public revisions) are archived in [`docs/migration/upstream-metadata/`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/tree/main/docs/migration/upstream-metadata). Links above are attribution; this issue is newly created for the independent project, not an impersonated original.\n\n## Persistent technical record\n[`docs/audit/findings/NATIVE.json`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/findings/NATIVE.json) · [Audit](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/README.md) · [Roadmap](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/roadmap/README.md)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/75/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/75/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]